    "implementation_delta": "Publish AccelerateSbomAndProvenance@1, DatasetsSbomAndProvenance@1, KitSbomAndProvenance@1, and PlatformSbomAndProvenanceCatalog@1. Each component SBOM is a declared_release_profile SPDX-2.3 document of the PCPR-053 lock (Accelerate 24 direct specs, Datasets empty core, Kit 22 direct specs). Each provenance document is a declared_build_binding of source policy, sealed-PATH tools, native dependencies, intended commands, artifacts, and containers. Live Syft/CycloneDX/Trivy scans, signed SLSA/in-toto/cosign attestations, hashed transitive graphs, file analysis, and published wheel/sdist/container identities stay typed unavailable. Hashes were not invented. Mutable origin/main is not the release identity. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
  },
